00:28:29.000 --> 00:28:35.370
So, if you retrieve the gene record, let's
say we search for the APRT record and you

00:28:35.370 --> 00:28:38.330
found all of the literature link to the gene
in the gene record.

00:28:38.330 --> 00:28:43.980
In fact, that particular panel that comes
up for the APRT -let me escape out of here

00:28:43.980 --> 00:28:47.020
and I will go back to that one.

00:28:47.020 --> 00:28:51.549
I thought there was a literature, yeah there
